<div class="dqa-ui-wrapper">

    <p class="dqa-ui-intro">
        World-wide interface changes made by this module, collected here. Each switch applies
        immediately — there is nothing to save.
    </p>

    <fieldset class="dqa-ui-section">
        <legend><i class="fas fa-skull"></i> Daggerheart Sidebar Menu</legend>

        <div class="dqa-ui-row">
            <label for="dqa-menu-enhancements">Menu Enhancements</label>
            <input type="checkbox" id="dqa-menu-enhancements" class="dh-toggle" name="menuEnhancements"
                   {{#if menuEnhancements}}checked{{/if}}>
        </div>

        <p class="dqa-ui-hint">
            Turns off everything this module changes in the system's own sidebar menu: the purple
            skull tab icon, the search bar, the alphabetical section ordering, the collapsible
            sections and the two-column button grid. The module's own <strong>Quick Actions</strong>
            section stays in the menu either way — only its layout falls back to the system default.
        </p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="dqa-ui-section">
        <legend><i class="fas fa-address-card"></i> Character Sheet</legend>

        <div class="dqa-ui-row">
            <label for="dqa-biography-policy">Biography Tab Visibility</label>
            <select id="dqa-biography-policy" class="dh-select" name="biographyPolicy">
                {{#each policyChoices}}
                <option value="{{this.value}}" {{#if this.selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>
                {{/each}}
            </select>
        </div>

        <p class="dqa-ui-hint">
            World-wide rule for the Biography tab on character sheets. <strong>Each user decides</strong>
            honors every user's own <strong>Hide Biography Tab</strong> setting, which each player
            controls from the module settings list.
        </p>
    </fieldset>

</div>
